  "notes": "Version at this commit: 8.13-SNAPSHOT. Reactor: vaadin-root, vaadin-shared, vaadin-push (provided-scope dependency of vaadin-server, built by -am, not used), vaadin-server, vaadin-compatibility-shared, vaadin-compatibility-server; no GWT client module is built. -DskipTests still compiles the tests, which the reactor needs (compatibility-server has a test dependency on vaadin-server:tests); -Dcheckstyle.skip=true skips the checkstyle report. As in the release jars, the build compiles into vaadin-shared the elemental json/util sources it unpacks from com.google.gwt:gwt-elemental 2.8.2 and into vaadin-server the VaadinIcons.java it unpacks from com.vaadin:vaadin-icons 3.0.2 (a separate Vaadin project); class files target Java 8. Fixed: the four artifacts at 8.13.0."
